36.147000","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/cocoa_ruto|@cocoa_ruto\u003e: Emacs Lispで(progn! (a) b (c) (d) e (f))って書いたら(progn (a) (b (c) (d) (e (f))))って書いたことになるマクロってないだろうか。\n(progn!\n let ((a 1))\n save-excursion\n if (b) (c)\n let ((d (e))\n if (f) (g)\n (h))\nとか書きたい。","id":1,"author_name":"ると","author_subname":"@cocoa_ruto","author_link":"https://twitter.com/cocoa_ruto/status/1384169250516967425","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/27437852/arm_watch_normal.png","text":"Emacs Lispで(progn! (a) b (c) (d) e (f))って書いたら(progn (a) (b (c) (d) (e (f))))って書いたことになるマクロってないだろうか。\n(progn!\n let ((a 1))\n save-excursion\n if (b) (c)\n let ((d (e))\n if (f) (g)\n (h))\nとか書きたい。","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1618846640,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/cocoa_ruto/status/1384169250516967425","original_url":"https://twitter.com/cocoa_ruto/status/1384169250516967425"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qq5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7cc7b1da-fa5b-4399-a7fe-5dc8d642e442","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あ、`interacrive \"r\"`で`beg`、`end`に入れてるのでこうしなくちゃか。\n\n```(defun my/trans-deepl (beg end)\n  (interactive \"r\")\n  (let ((str (buffer-substring beg end)))\n    (browse-url\n     (concat \"\u003chttps://www.deepl.com/translator#en/ja/\u003e\" (url-hexify-string str)))))```","ts":"1618901641.146600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fu7fk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1999800d-4f89-4d0d-a986-3b38779d231b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"短い","ts":"1618901549.146000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LHjU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e506e79a-f331-42ff-ac14-a0ae2a37220f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/dps-deepl-browser\u003e\n習作。\n```(defun my/trans-deepl (beg end)\n  (interactive \"r\")\n  (let ((str (buffer-substring (region-beginning) (region-end))))\n    (browse-url\n     (concat \"\u003chttps://www.deepl.com/translator#en/ja/\u003e\" (url-hexify-string str)))))```\n範囲選択したところの文章を取得するのが、 `(buffer-substring (region-beginning) (region-end))` うーん。ダサいなぁ。。","ts":"1618901515.145700","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: yuki-yano/dps-deepl-browser","id":1,"title":"yuki-yano/dps-deepl-browser","title_link":"https://github.com/yuki-yano/dps-deepl-browser","text":"Contribute to yuki-yano/dps-deepl-browser development by creating an account on GitHub.","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/767bc62af9c385d3bbf04317e0c48cb1274ff7c54cbd9d6459fd6060cf50979d/yuki-yano/dps-deepl-browser","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/yuki-yano/dps-deepl-browser","original_url":"https://github.com/yuki-yano/dps-deepl-browser"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XkKp"}]}]
